{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay is a bit disappointing, so don\u2019t expect much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a shame, but it's the first simple puzzle arcade game I've developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It may be a bit difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By playing repeatedly, you can earn coins and upgrade your players to make the game a little easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Take the challenge!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 tutorial levels and 6 challenging levels await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Solve various puzzles and gimmicks. Test your senses</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need some control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Don't be afraid of failure.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can try again at any time. Even developers who may have played more games than anyone else have experienced many failures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To be honest, I don't have any expectations, but if I get a certain amount of sales, I'm thinking of slowing down the development of the new game and adding playable levels and various elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>If you would like to give your opinion, please join Discord</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2930990?t=1744131415","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744131415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930990/78f7b5c41878460216d3e39da5cf7b5e59f19fc3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744131415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930990/78f7b5c41878460216d3e39da5cf7b5e59f19fc3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744131415","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay is a bit disappointing, so don\u2019t expect much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a shame, but it's the first simple puzzle arcade game I've developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It may be a bit difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By playing repeatedly, you can earn coins and upgrade your players to make the game a little easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Take the challenge!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 tutorial levels and 6 challenging levels await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Solve various puzzles and gimmicks. Test your senses</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need some control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Don't be afraid of failure.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can try again at any time. Even developers who may have played more games than anyone else have experienced many failures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To be honest, I don't have any expectations, but if I get a certain amount of sales, I'm thinking of slowing down the development of the new game and adding playable levels and various elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>If you would like to give your opinion, please join Discord</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Jewelry"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930990/header.jpg?t=1744131415","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"mi